BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 531.89 Tm (Many students in Batangas City stop looking for financial assistance because the information is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 516.89 Tm (scattered. Scholarship announcements are posted on different websites, Facebook pages and bulletin) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 501.89 Tm (boards, and each program has its own requirements, grade requirement and application period. A) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 486.89 Tm (student who wants to apply must read every announcement one by one to find out whether he or she is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 471.89 Tm (even qualified, and often discovers too late that one requirement was missing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 451.89 Tm (SchoHub answers this problem with one website that keeps a catalog of scholarship programs and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 436.89 Tm (matches a student only to the programs that student can realistically apply for. The system is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 421.89 Tm (developed in Java using the Spring Boot framework and is built on the principles of object-oriented) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 406.89 Tm (programming: encapsulation of student and program data in model classes, inheritance and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 391.89 Tm (polymorphism in the eligibility rules, and a layered architecture that separates the user interface, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 376.89 Tm (business logic and the database.) Tj ET
