BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.00 294.89 Tm (City;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 68.00 277.89 Tm (∑) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.00 277.89 Tm (match each student to the programs he or she is qualified for using multiple criteria, not a single) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.00 262.89 Tm (grade;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 68.00 245.89 Tm (∑) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.00 245.89 Tm (show, for every program, exactly which requirements are already met and which are still missing;) Tj ET
