BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 588.89 Tm (Students save time and avoid wasted effort because they only see programs they are qualified for and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 573.89 Tm (they know in advance which documents are missing. Parents and guidance offices can use the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 558.89 Tm (checklist to prepare requirements early. Scholarship providers reach the right applicants. For the) Tj ET
